kw.msg:
Executing JavaScript:
var el = document.querySelector('div.overflow-x-auto');if (el) { el.scrollLeft = el.scrollWidth; }
Without any arguments.

Executing JavaScript:
var rows = document.querySelectorAll('tr');for (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {if (rows[i].innerText.includes('เกศรา กฤติขจร')) {var btn = rows[i].querySelector('button[title="แก้ไข"]');if (btn) { btn.click(); break; }}}
Without any arguments.

